            "text": "<ul><li>Pick up a punch card at the <a href=\"https://maps.app.goo.gl/vYhHyeK5jEDxZir49\" target=\"_blank\" title=\"https://maps.app.goo.gl/vYhHyeK5jEDxZir49\">Ornot Showroom</a></li><li>Sign up and enter your info. <a href=\"/pages/tam-week-sign-up\" target=\"_blank\" title=\"Tam Week Sign-Up\">HERE</a></li><li>Ride any route to <a href=\"https://maps.app.goo.gl/aaxDGLDJGc2dZN7h8\" target=\"_blank\" title=\"https://maps.app.goo.gl/aaxDGLDJGc2dZN7h8\">West Peak</a> (not East Peak) </li><li>Find the hole punch (check <a href=\"https://www.instagram.com/ornotbike/\" target=\"_blank\" title=\"https://www.instagram.com/ornotbike/\">@ornotbike</a> for location)</li><li>Log your ride(s) on Strava or RWGPS</li><li>Celebrate at the after party <strong>Friday night, 7/10  </strong>(<a href=\"https://maps.app.goo.gl/vYhHyeK5jEDxZir49\" target=\"_blank\" title=\"https://maps.app.goo.gl/vYhHyeK5jEDxZir49\">59 Clement St.</a> // Raffle at 7:00pm)</li></ul><p><em>*Ascents must start sub 200 ft. of elevation. Only </em><em><strong>one ascent per day</strong></em><em> counts towards your Tam Week total*</em></p>",
